# Session 2: 1796, one player, the Allies (the shipped NWS.CFG), Tactical off.
# The computer plays France (docs\won-source-study.md, section 3.2). The Allies only end
# their turns, and France takes its objective in the fourth turn, which ends the game.
seed 1
pace 1

wait 4
key space
wait 4
key s
wait 2
key enter
wait 3
shot objective
key space
wait 1
key u t esc
wait 1
shot main-menu

# Two turns. Spaces close the event messages; at the main menu a space matches no
# item and does nothing.
repeat 2
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 6
key space
wait 3
end
shot next-turn
end

# The third turn ends the game: France has captured its objective. The game asks
# "End Game: Yes / No-Override" (a space matches neither); Yes shows the Battle Summary,
# then the Hall of Fame, "Game Over" and the start menu, from which the session quits.
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 6
key space
wait 3
end
shot french-win
key y
wait 3
shot battle-summary
key space
wait 5
shot hall-of-fame
key space
wait 3
shot game-over
key space
wait 5
shot start-menu
key q
wait 3
shot dos
